<title>USA: Triton Energy Yumeca-2 well being plugged.</title>
<headline>Triton Energy Yumeca-2 well being plugged.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triton Energy said Wednesday that the Yumeca-2 exploratory well in Colombia on the El Pinal Block is being plugged and abandoned.</p>
<p>Electric logs failed to confirm the presence of commercial quantities of oil or gas, the company said.</p>
<p>The well was drilled to a total depth of 13,500 feet, the company said. Triton said it began drilling Yumeca-2 in late 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1710))</p>
